  (text "PNM-MAIN Rev A notes"
    (exclude_from_sim no)
    (at 30.48 160 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.27 1.27)
      )
      (justify left)
    )
    (uuid "df203b6c-cd81-54de-9eef-9829ec5b3159")
  )
  (text "1. U3 (MDBT50Q) runs in nRF52840 high-voltage mode: VDDH = VSYS, VDD is an OUTPUT (+3V3_AON, <=25 mA)."
    (exclude_from_sim no)
    (at 30.48 164.5 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.27 1.27)
      )
      (justify left)
    )
    (uuid "50d709d4-72c3-5732-8921-6ba5f8bc5c4e")
  )
  (text "   Firmware must program UICR.REGOUT0 = 3.3 V on first boot (factory default is 1.8 V). P0.18 must be PSELRESET."
    (exclude_from_sim no)
    (at 30.48 169 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.27 1.27)
      )
      (justify left)
    )
    (uuid "1f2f9672-042d-58a8-8399-fa40e322672e")
  )
  (text "2. Core1106 pins 60/61/62/67 (WiFi control via 1k) and 63/64/68/69 (BT UART) are shared on the -1408 variant: do not use."
    (exclude_from_sim no)
    (at 30.48 173.5 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.27 1.27)
      )
      (justify left)
    )
    (uuid "0c8796cd-e9e5-51b8-8cfd-c02a04a39438")
  )
  (text "3. nRF must drive SoC-facing lines (SOC_RX, SOC_WAKE, SOC_NPOR) low or Hi-Z whenever SOC_EN is low (no back-powering)."
    (exclude_from_sim no)
    (at 30.48 178 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.27 1.27)
      )
      (justify left)
    )
    (uuid "5ac2ee77-bc4b-5cf7-a392-6aaa2f41434f")
  )
  (text "4. Camera J4 follows the Luckfox 20P pinout. Verify FFC contact side / pin-1 with the SC3336 (B) before ordering the compact module."
    (exclude_from_sim no)
    (at 30.48 182.5 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.27 1.27)
      )
      (justify left)
    )
    (uuid "be1b20af-ad57-540c-a55f-44a4dd7cf8b1")
  )
  (text "5. J5 -> PNM-PWR J5 over a straight-through 30P 0.5 mm FFC routed under the battery."
    (exclude_from_sim no)
    (at 30.48 187 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.27 1.27)
      )
      (justify left)
    )
    (uuid "2b347108-f70d-55f7-9985-9a29a10a21dc")
  )
